[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u4e8c\u5341\u516d\u5173\uff08\u524d\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_wild_a",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_bat_game02_intro",
        "key": "$m_bat_game02_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, what do you think about Penguin Logistics, Amiya? We're pretty good, aren't we?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, you're great!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "W-woaaah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "It feels pretty embarrassing getting complimented by a little girl!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch your mouth. She's our client.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oops, sorry about that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry about it. It's you who we should be thanking!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, we've met up with Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's next?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I might need the L.G.D. to come to a decision before I give my input.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that so...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll ask them to come take a look over here then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "This terrain...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion must have lured us here on purpose.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing but sand and rocks in this wasteland. It's got all the makings of one of those movie showdowns.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "The only thing that's missing is the enemy, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoshiguma, stay here and back up Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? Very well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll take the L.G.D. and change positions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "If this stalemate continues, we won't be able to control Reunion's escape routes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "You take care as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "--Wooah, that was a really strong wind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... The visibility's getting really poor too, I can barely see ahead of me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't go any farther.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion might wait for us to fall into their trap before they attack again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't let that happen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How about this, Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Liskarm and I will fight for control over the high ground around here and scout out the enemy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Until we notify you, stay in this position.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just don't rush out to us even if looks like the fighting is getting intense, Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I know. I'll make my own judgment call.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, you keep an eye on her too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll be in touch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The ruins are empty. The high ground is currently undefended.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's curious, does Reunion not have any commanders?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Franka, is something wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those place was supposed to be easy to defend but hard to attack.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no way that Reunion hasn't set up an ambush...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Die, traitors!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch... No sense of honor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Franka!! Behind you!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see Reunion forces coming up from the nearby ruins!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "afrom": 0,
        "rfrom": 0,
        "gfrom": 0,
        "bfrom": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$p_imp_sword_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough*... I couldn't see... her sword?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "How... is that possible...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you really think you could ambush us from there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you think you're underestimating me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Blacksteel...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "Fall back! Hurry!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I really thought there'd be more Reunion goons up here. I was even walking on tiptoes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Turns out it's just a bunch of cowards. How disappointing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're going to get disappointed over that?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "More importantly, we have to go after them! Don't let them get away so easily!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, what do you think?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think... it's best not to risk it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's let Penguin Logistics stabilize the situation before we decide on the next thing to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Exusiai, can you prioritize securing the high ground?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure thing! I'm on my way!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good, continue pressuring the enemy. Don't let Reunion stage a counterattack!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion is trying to regroup after retreating a bit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're... bringing something out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "That thing...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "is no ordinary thug!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never expected Reunion to be working with...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Could that be...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Working with who?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right, this Reunion soldier does look different...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Could it be...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Liskarm, we're currently working with the L.G.D.... It's probably not the best time to be talking about sensitive topics!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Ah, understood.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(I'll tell you my theory next time!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*yawns*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone, please get ready!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "This... might be a very difficult battle!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
